# Demo-store swap state — products-small.json is rewritten in place by `task.py`
# (clean ↔ injected). The git canonical is the *injected* variant (so a fresh
# clone is already configured for `attack` and `defended` runs); `clean` mode
# rewrites it locally and `task.py teardown` reverses the swap.
demo-store/data/products-small.json.bak
